    <item>
      <title>花旗的商人超过了对波动浪潮的期望</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-15/citi-s-traders-beat-expectations-on-wave-of-volatility-video</link>
      <description><![CDATA[花旗集团的贸易商在第一季度超出了期望，在此期间获得了60亿美元的收入，这有助于固定收入增长8％，股票交易收益增长了23％。 Sonali Basak报道了彭博电视台。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-15/citi-s-traders-beat-expectations-on-wave-of-volatility-video</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 12:34:51 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
